  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PER/PHA/93/PRP/63 - Preparation of Stage III Hydrochlorofluorocarbons (HCFC) Phase-out Management Plan (HPMP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hydrochlorofluorocarbons (HCFCs) are classified as controlled substances under Annex-C, Group-I of the Montreal Protocol and therefore, have production and consumption restrictions and would have to be phased-out for controlled use applications. Peru, as a Party to the Montreal Protocol, is mandated to phase out consumption of HCFCs in line with the Montreal Protocol phase-out schedule.Peru through implementation of HPMP Stage-II will meet the 2025 compliance targets as per the accelerated phase</narrative>
  </description>
